id: kindhearted-saiyan-second-effect
name: Kindhearted Saiyan
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: kindhearted-saiyan
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Kindhearted Saiyan's second effect, as a Maneuver: a stack of Battle Born on an Ally's turn - their Combat Rolls 1(T) till yours.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver during an Ally’s turn, you may spend a stack of Battle Born to target that Ally. That Ally has their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

# The Ally whose turn it is, targeted: which Combat Roll's stack, asked where more than one has any - their Combat Rolls 1(T), yours,
# till the start of your next turn (chat.mjs kindheartedBoost; combat.mjs beginTurn).
[on used]
kindheartedBoost();
